#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:29
msgid ""
"Price Phase Tasks are only invoked when the Workflow is tied to a Layout."
" Like the Configuration Phase, these Tasks are run prior to any calls "
"made to the target Cloud API and allow pricing data to be overridden for "
"the Workload being provisioned. A \"spec\" variable containing Instance "
"config is passed into the Task and a specific return payload is expected "
"in order to work properly. Any other pricing (such as on the Service "
"Plan) is overridden. See the section below for a detailed example of this"
" Phase being used."
msgstr "Price Phase Tasks are only invoked when the Workflow is tied to a Layout. Like the Configuration Phase, these Tasks are run prior to any calls made to the target Cloud API and allow pricing data to be overridden for the Workload being provisioned. A \"spec\" variable containing Instance config is passed into the Task and a specific return payload is expected in order to work properly. Any other pricing (such as on the Service Plan) is overridden. See the section below for a detailed example of this Phase being used."

