#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Running:** Charge is incurred while the workload is in a running state,"
" **Stopped:** Charge is incurred while the workload is in a stopped or "
"shutdown state, **Always:** This charge is always applied. Some charges "
"may apply simultaneously, for example, \"Always\" and \"Running\" states "
"will apply while the workload is running."
msgstr "**Running:** Charge is incurred while the workload is in a running state, **Stopped:** Charge is incurred while the workload is in a stopped or shutdown state, **Always:** This charge is always applied. Some charges may apply simultaneously, for example, \"Always\" and \"Running\" states will apply while the workload is running."

